# Workspace Projects

Follow `docs/policy/workspace-project-policy.md`.

- UI-only app-libs use `scope:ui type:app-lib layer:<feature|ui|data-access|util>`.
- Shared app-libs require named UI and API consumers.
- App-libs are source-consumed: no tsdown, build tsconfig, or publishConfig.
- Export one module per singular subpath; pin the exports map in a test.
- Inject app concerns; never import UI app aliases from an app-lib.
- Generate projects with `package --scope=apps/libs --scope-tag=<scope> --layer=<layer> [--react]`.
